Your Ultimate Document ChecklistGroup these files on your computer into a single folder so you can upload them easily on Wednesday. All documents must be PDF or JPEG and under 5 MB each.1. Personal Identity DocumentsYour Passport: High-resolution color scan of the front page (photo page) and back page (address page).Passport Photo: A fresh digital passport photo with a plain white background (40mm x 50mm, JPEG).2. Financial & Professional Proof (Do this on Wednesday)Bank Statement: A 3-month statement downloaded after your salary hits, showing a final closing balance of ₹1.5 Lakhs+.Salary Slips: Payslips from your employer for the last 3 months.Employment Verification: An official Leave Approval Letter or No Objection Certificate (NOC) on your company’s letterhead, signed by HR, stating your travel dates are approved.3. Travel & Group Validation DocumentsFlight Tickets: Confirmed round-trip tickets (India ✈️ Hong Kong ✈️ Vietnam ✈️ India).Hotel Voucher: Confirmed hotel booking confirmation in Hong Kong for your 3-day stay.Friends’ PAR Approvals: A single PDF containing the 3 approved PAR notification slips and the first page of your 3 friends' passports.Cover Letter & Itinerary: The customized cover letter and day-wise travel itinerary table we formatted earlier, saved as PDFs.⏱️
